ion)\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Battle of Endor (disambiguation)\">Battle of Endor</a></b>.</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Media pi-layout-default\">\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/f/f0/Wegbattleendor.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20070525191923\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Wegbattleendor\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/f/f0/Wegbattleendor.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20070525191923\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/f/f0/Wegbattleendor.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20070525191923 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/f/f0/Wegbattleendor.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20070525191923 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Wegbattleendor\" width=\"270\" height=\"367\" data-image-key=\"Wegbattleendor.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Wegbattleendor.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\"><i>Battle for Endor</i></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Attribution information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author(s)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Peter Corless (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGV0ZXJfQ29ybGVzcz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Peter Corless</span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Publication information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"publisher\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Publisher</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/West_End_Games\" title=\"West End Games\">West End Games</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1989\" title=\"1989\">1989</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Date&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Date-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"isbn\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Standard_Book_Number\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:International Standard Book Number\">ISBN</a></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/087431190X\" title=\"Special:BookSources/087431190X\">087431190X</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><small><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Template:ReferenceBook\">[Source]</a></span></small></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Battle for Endor</b></i> is a solitaire board game published by <a href=\"/wiki/West_End_Games\" title=\"West End Games\">West End Games</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1989\" title=\"1989\">1989</a>, designed by Peter Corless.\n</p><p>The game includes:\n</p>\n<ul><li>terrain map</li>\n<li>62 stand-up playing pieces</li>\n<li>Action Cards deck</li>\n<li>Event Cards deck</li>\n<li>6 special fire dice</li>\n<li>rules manual</li></ul>\n<table id=\"Game-stub\" class=\"noprint stub\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/6/6f/Gamepad-icon.svg/revision/latest?cb=20250725005656\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gamepad-icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gamepad-icon.svg\" data-image-key=\"Gamepad-icon.svg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/6/6f/Gamepad-icon.svg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20250725005656\" /></a></span> This game-related article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Wookieepedia:Stub\" title=\"Wookieepedia:Stub\">stub</a>. You can help Wookieepedia by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Battle_for_Endor?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.\n</span></th></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Publisher&#39;s_summary\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Publisher's summary</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Notes_and_references\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes and references</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Publisher.27s_summary\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Publisher's_summary\">Publisher's summary</span></h2>\n<p><i>A SOLITAIRE GAME Using the STAR WARS HEROIC BATTLES Game System!</i>\n</p><p><i>THE SITUATION SEEMS HOPELESS!</i>\n</p><p><i>Hundreds of Imperial troops surround the Rebel strike team: stormtroopers, speeder bikes, and AT-ST walkers. The mission has failed. With the energy field still protecting the new Death Star, the Rebel fleet faces imminent destruction.</i>\n</p><p><i>The last hope of the Alliance lies with a handful of captured heroes and an unorganized army of natives &#8212; Ewoks &#8212; whose weaponry is no match for Imperial firepower. Can you, as the Rebel leader, reverse the fortunes of war?</i>\n</p><p><i>An innovative solitaire system controls the Imperial forces. Your enemy has great firepower and the ability to shift tactics. All you have is your skill, your courage &#8212; and the primitive technology of a clever and resourceful ally. May the Force be with you.</i>\n</p><p><i>STAR WARS: BATTLE FOR ENDOR recreates the critical battle on the Forest Moon from </i>Return of the Jedi'<b></b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noprint darkbackground1\" style=\"background: #f2f5fd; font-size: 0.85em; text-align: center; margin: 0 auto 3px auto; overflow: auto; border-radius: 10px; padding: 5px 0\">Explore all of Wookieepedia's <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Images_from_Battle_for_Endor\" title=\"Category:Images from Battle for Endor\">images</a></b> from this article subject.</div>\n<div class=\"hidable start-hidden\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<b>By type</b>&#32;<span class=\"hidable-button\"></span><table style=\"width:50%\">\n\n</table><table id=\"appearancesTOC\" style=\"padding:5px; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; -moz-border-radius:6px; margin:0 auto 4px auto\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_characters\">Characters</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;color:gray; font-style:italic;\">Organisms\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_droids\">Droid models</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_events\">Events</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_locations\">Locations</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_organizations\">Organizations and titles</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_species\">Sentient species</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_vehicles\">Vehicles and vessels</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_technology\">Weapons and technology</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1em;\"><a href=\"#app_miscellanea\">Miscellanea</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"hidable-content\" style=\"clear:both; text-align:left\">\n<p id=\"app&#95;characters\" style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:larger\">Characters</p><table id=\"appearancesSection\" style=\"width:100%\">\n\n</table><table class=\"appearances\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/C-3PO/Legends\" title=\"C-3PO/Legends\">C-3PO</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chewbacca/Legends\" title=\"Chewbacca/Legends\">Chewbacca</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chirpa/Legends\" title=\"Chirpa/Legends\">Chirpa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Logray/Legends\" title=\"Logray/Legends\">Logray</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Leia_Organa_Solo/Legends\" title=\"Leia Organa Solo/Legends\">Leia Organa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Han_Solo/Legends\" title=\"Han Solo/Legends\">Han Solo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/R2-D2/Legends\" title=\"R2-D2/Legends\">R2-D2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Romba/Legends\" title=\"Romba/Legends\">Romba</a> <small>(Picture only)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wicket_Wystri_Warrick/Legends\" title=\"Wicket Wystri Warrick/Legends\"