trooper/Legends\" title=\"Stormtrooper/Legends\">Stormtrooper</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p id=\"app&#95;species\" style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:larger\">Sentient species</p>\n<table class=\"appearances\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ewok/Legends\" title=\"Ewok/Legends\">Ewok</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Human/Legends\" title=\"Human/Legends\">Human</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wookiee/Legends\" title=\"Wookiee/Legends\">Wookiee</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p id=\"app&#95;vehicles\" style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:larger\">Vehicles and vessels</p>\n<table class=\"appearances\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/All_Terrain_Scout_Transport/Legends\" title=\"All Terrain Scout Transport/Legends\">All Terrain Scout Transport</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Star/Legends\" title=\"Death Star/Legends\">Death Star</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Star_II/Legends\" title=\"Death Star II/Legends\">Death Star II</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mon_Calamari_Star_Cruiser/Legends\" title=\"Mon Calamari Star Cruiser/Legends\">Mon Calamari Star Cruiser</a> <small>(as Rebel Cruiser)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Speeder_bike/Legends\" title=\"Speeder bike/Legends\">Speeder bike</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/74-Z_speeder_bike/Legends\" title=\"74-Z speeder bike/Legends\">74-Z speeder bike</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p id=\"app&#95;technology\" style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:larger\">Weapons and technology</p>\n<table class=\"appearances\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blast_door/Legends\" title=\"Blast door/Legends\">Blast door</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Blaster/Legends\" title=\"Blaster/Legends\">Blaster</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Catapult/Legends\" title=\"Catapult/Legends\">Catapult</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Deflector_shield_generator/Legends\" title=\"Deflector shield generator/Legends\">Deflector shield generator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Melee_weapon/Legends\" title=\"Melee weapon/Legends\">Melee weapon</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow/Legends\" title=\"Arrow/Legends\">Arrow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bow/Legends\" title=\"Bow/Legends\">Bow</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Club/Legends\" title=\"Club/Legends\">Club</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rock\" class=\"mw-redirect mw-disambig\" title=\"Rock\">Rock</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spear/Legends\" title=\"Spear/Legends\">Spear</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Repulsorlift/Legends\" title=\"Repulsorlift/Legends\">Repulsorlift</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><p id=\"app&#95;miscellanea\" style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:larger\">Miscellanea</p>\n<table class=\"appearances\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Moon/Legends\" title=\"Moon/Legends\">Moon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/The_galaxy/Legends\" title=\"The galaxy/Legends\">The galaxy</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_references\">Notes and references</span></h2>\n<div class=\"references-small\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Date-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Date_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"mti\"><span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-baseline\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/StarWars.com\" title=\"Cargo Bay\"><img alt=\"Cargo Bay\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/6/6f/CargoBay.svg/revision/latest?cb=20250625184024\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"CargoBay.svg\" data-image-key=\"CargoBay.svg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20041225222146/https://cargobay.starwars.com/webapps/cargobay/item-detail/7736\">Battle for Endor</a> in the <a href=\"/wi