links\" title=\"ka:Battle for Endor\"><a href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/ka/wiki/Battle_for_Endor\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:ka.starwars:Battle for Endor\">ქართული</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>"}